                    "_type": "Diesel Product Footer",
                    "copy": "© 2020 Frontier Developments, plc. All rights reserved. Frontier and the Frontier Developments logo are trademarks or registered trademarks of Frontier Developments, plc. © 2018-2020 Universal City Studios LLC and Amblin Entertainment, Inc. The use of this game is subject to Frontier’s License Agreement, available at frontierstore.net/jwe-legal",
